@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+# Micro Input navigation and execution bridge
+
+The bridge is disabled unless `MI_ZCODE_BRIDGE_CONFIG` names a private JSON file containing explicit `scopes` and an optional private `directory`. It creates a fresh capability and generation for one window renderer. Additional windows never take over an occupied socket. Renderer replacement invalidates all outstanding requests.
+
+Requests are bounded NDJSON, authenticated before metadata or command access, and scoped by the complete workspace/source address. Only `list`, exact `open`, `create` (`createSession`), `send` (`sendText`), `stop` (`expectedForegroundExecutionId`), and `query` (`queryConversationCommandsV4`) are allowed. The scoped Controller list reuses its v4 source index and projects only address, title, live status, and active foreground execution ID; no conversation subscription, transcript read, or text search is exposed.
+
+Open and create recheck the owner metadata, live attachment and exact existing workspace tab, then select and read back the target task in one synchronous renderer turn. Send and stop require `selected == target` so two sessions only affect the selected one. Stop requires `expectedForegroundExecutionId` so a late stop returns `noop` (`guard.stopTargetChanged`) instead of stopping a newer execution. Commands are idempotent by `(sessionId, commandId)` and reconcile via `query` on timeout without replaying under a new ID. In-flight sending to a running session never creates a new session and reports `delivery` (`guide` -> `steered`, `queue` -> `queued`, `startNow` -> `started`) explicitly.
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+  participant MI as Micro Input
+  participant Main as Desktop main
+  participant UI as Window renderer
+  participant Host as Same Host Controller
+  MI->>Main: capability + generation + exact scope
+  Main->>Main: authenticate and authorize before forwarding
+  Main->>UI: scoped request (list / open / create / send / stop / query)
+  UI->>Host: scoped metadata index / getTaskMeta / v4 command
+  Host-->>UI: projected metadata / CommandAck
+  UI->>UI: recheck attachment, verify selected==target, read selection
+  UI-->>Main: projected result (confirmed / started / queued / steered / stopped / noop / unknown)
+  Main-->>MI: generation-bound result
+```
